Algorithms adapted from other solvers
-------------------------------------

Tactix's default strategy reimplements the search and inprocessing mechanisms
of Kissat and CaDiCaL (Copyright (c) Armin Biere and contributors, MIT
License), its symmetry breaking follows Satsuma, and several structure-aware
techniques follow LymphoSAT. These are independent implementations of the
published algorithms and schedules; no source code from those solvers is
included in this repository.

External tools used at run time
-------------------------------

The proof checkers (drat-trim, cake_lpr, dsr-trim, Trestle, VeriPB, CakePB)
and the reference solvers used in benchmarks are not distributed here.
tools/checkers/setup.sh and tools/solvers/setup.sh download them from their
upstream repositories at pinned commits, and the patches in
tools/checkers/patches/ apply to those checkouts under their own licenses.
